<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAL" style="id">- Biblica® Open Luganda Contemporary Bible 2014</book>
  <para style="h">Malaki</para>
  <para style="toc1">Malaki</para>
  <para style="toc2">Malaki</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mal</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ekitabo Ekiyitibwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Malaki</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAL 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 1:1"/>Buno bwe bubaka <char style="nd">Mukama</char> bwe yawa Malaki abutuuse eri abaana ba Isirayiri.<verse eid="MAL 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okwagala kwa <char style="nd">Mukama</char> eri Isirayiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 1:2"/>“Nabaagala,” bw’ayogera <char style="nd">Mukama</char>.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 1:2">“Naye mmwe ne mumbuuza nti, ‘Watwagala otya?’ </para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 1:2">“Esawu teyali muganda wa Yakobo?” bw’ayogera <char style="nd">Mukama</char>: “naye nze Yakobo gwe nayagala. <verse eid="MAL 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 1:3"/>Esawu namukyawa ne nfuula ensi ye ey’ensozi okuba amatongo, obusika bwe ne mbuwa ebibe eby’omu ddungu.”<verse eid="MAL 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 1:4"/>Singa Edomu, ekika ekyava mu Esawu kigamba nti, “Wadde tukubiddwa wansi naye tulidda ne tuzimba ebyagwa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 1:4">
    <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ow’Eggye ayogera nti, “Bo balizimba, naye nze ndibimenya; era abantu banaabayitanga, ensi embi, era nti abantu <char style="nd">Mukama</char> be yanyiigira ennaku zonna. <verse eid="MAL 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 1:5"/>Era amaaso gammwe galiraba ne mwogera nti, ‘<char style="nd">Mukama</char> agulumizibwe okusukka ensalo ya Isirayiri.’<verse eid="MAL 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekibi kya Bakabona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 1:6"/>“Omwana assaamu kitaawe ekitiibwa, n’omuddu atya mukama we. Kale obanga ddala ndi kitammwe, ekitiibwa kye munzisaamu kiri ludda wa? Era obanga ndi mukama wammwe, lwaki temuntya?” bw’ayogera <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ow’Eggye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 1:6">
    <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ow’Eggye bw’abagamba mmwe nti, “Mmwe bakabona munyooma erinnya lyange.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 1:6">“Ne mubuuza nti, ‘Twayonoona tutya?’ <verse eid="MAL 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 1:7"/>“Muwaayo ku kyoto kyange emmere eyonoonese.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 1:7">“Kyokka ne mwebuuza nti, ‘Twakwonoona tutya?’ </para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 1:7">“Kubanga olujjuliro lwange mulufuula ekitagasa. <verse eid="MAL 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 1:8"/>Bwe muwaayo ensolo enzibe z’amaaso okuba ssaddaaka, muba temukoze kibi? Ate bwe muwaayo eziwenyera oba endwadde, ekyo si kibi? Kale nno mugezeeko okuzitonera omufuzi wammwe, anaabasanyukira? Ye anaafaayo okukutunulako?” bw’ayogera <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ow’Eggye.<verse eid="MAL 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 1:9"/>“Kale nno mbasaba mwegayirire Katonda, atukwatirwe ekisa, kubanga ebyo ffe twabyereetera. Nga muleese ebiweebwayo ebifaanana bityo, waliwo n’omu gw’ayinza okukkiriza?” bw’ayogera <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ow’Eggye.<verse eid="MAL 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 1:10"/>“Kale waakiri singa omu ku bakabona aggalawo enzigi muleme okukuma omuliro ku kyoto kyange ogw’obwereere! Sibasanyukira n’akatono,” bw’ayogera <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ow’Eggye, “so sikkirize kiweebwayo kyonna ekiva mu mikono gyammwe. <verse eid="MAL 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 1:11"/>Kubanga okuva enjuba gy’eva okutuusa gy’egwa erinnya lyange kkulu mu baamawanga; obubaane buweerwayo mu buli kifo eri erinnya lyange, nga kuliko n’ekiweebwayo ekirongoofu, kubanga erinnya lyange kkulu mu baamawanga,” bw’ayogera <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ow’Eggye.<verse eid="MAL 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 1:12"/>“Naye mmwe bakabona muvumisa erinnya lyange mu baamawanga buli lukya nga mugamba nti kya Mukama okuwaayo emmere etesaana n’ebiweebwayo ku kyoto kyange. <verse eid="MAL 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 1:13"/>Era mwogera nti, ‘Nga tulabye;’ ne mugiwunyako ne mwetamwa, era ne mwesooza,” bw’ayogera <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ow’Eggye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 1:13">“Bwe muleeta ekinyage, n’ekiwenyera, n’ekirwadde, ebyo bye biweebwayo bye mulina okuleeta, mbikkirize?” bw’ayogera <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ow’Eggye. <verse eid="MAL 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 1:14"/>“Buli mulimba yenna akolimirwe, oyo alina ennume mu kisibo kye eyeeyama okugiwaayo nga ssaddaaka eri Mukama naye n’awaayo ekintu ekiriko obulema: kubanga ndi Kabaka mukulu,” bw’ayogera <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ow’Eggye, “n’erinnya lyange lya ntiisa mu baamawanga.”<verse eid="MAL 1:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAL 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Okulabula Bakabona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 2:1"/>“Kale nno, mmwe bakabona, ekiragiro kino kyammwe. <verse eid="MAL 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 2:2"/>Bwe mutaakyuse ku mpisa zammwe n’engeri zammwe, bwe mutaafeeyo kuwa linnya lyange kitiibwa,” bw’ayogera <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ow’Eggye, “kale ndibasindikira ekikolimo era emikisa gyammwe girifuuka ekikolimo. Ate ddala mmaze okubakolimira kubanga ebikulu gye ndi temubitaddeeko mwoyo.<verse eid="MAL 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 2:3"/>“Kale laba, ndibonereza ezzadde lyammwe, mbasiige n’obusa mu maaso, obusa bwa ssaddaaka zammwe, era mbagobewo mu maaso gange. <verse eid="MAL 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 2:4"/>Olwo lwe mulimanya nga mbawadde ekiragiro kino, endagaano yange ne Leevi eryoke etuukirire,” bw’ayogera <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ow’Eggye. <verse eid="MAL 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 2:5"/>“Endagaano eri mu mateeka ago yali egenderedde kuleeta bulamu na mirembe era n’embimuwa asobole okuntya, era n’antya n’ayimirira ng’atya erinnya lyange. <verse eid="MAL 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 2:6"/>Amateeka ag’amazima gali mu kamwa ke era nga tewali bulimba busangibwa mu kamwa ke. Yatambula nange mu mirembe ne mu butuukirivu era n’aggya bangi mu kibi.<verse eid="MAL 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 2:7"/>“Kubanga emimwa gy’abasumba gisaana okukuuma eby’amagezi ebya Katonda era abantu basaana okunoonya okutegeera okuva mu bo, kubanga be babaka ba <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ow’Eggye. <verse eid="MAL 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 2:8"/>Naye mwakyama ne muva mu kkubo; mwesittaza bangi olw’ebyo bye muyigiriza; mwayonoona endagaano ya Leevi,” bw’ayogera <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ow’Eggye. <verse eid="MAL 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 2:9"/>“Noolwekyo nabafuula ekinyoomebwa era ekisekererwa mu maaso g’abantu bonna olw’obutagoberera makubo gange era musala emisango nga musaliriza.”<verse eid="MAL 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okulabula eri Abatali Beesigwa mu Maka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 2:10"/>Kale ffenna tetulina kitaffe omu? Si Katonda omu eyatutonda? Lwaki kale tetuli beesigwa eri bantu bannaffe, ne twonoona endagaano ya bakitaffe?<verse eid="MAL 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 2:11"/>Yuda takuumye bwesigwa n’eby’omuzizo ne bikolebwa mu Isirayiri ne mu Yerusaalemi. Kubanga Yuda yayonoona ekifo kya <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ekitukuvu, ky’ayagala ennyo, bwe yawasa omuwala wa lubaale. <verse eid="MAL 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 2:12"/>Buli muntu yenna akola kino, oba kabona oba muntu wa bulijjo, <char style="nd">Mukama</char> alimuggya mu kika kya Yakobo, newaakubadde ng’aleeta ebiweebwayo eri <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ow’Eggye!<verse eid="MAL 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 2:13"/>Ekirala kye mukola kye kino: Ekyoto kya <char style="nd">Mukama</char> mukijjuzza amaziga, nga mukaaba nga mukuba ebiwoobe kubanga ebiweebwayo byammwe takyabifaako. <verse eid="MAL 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 2:14"/>Kale mubuuza nti, “Lwaki tabifaako?” Kubanga <char style="nd">Mukama</char> yali mujulirwa wakati wo ne mukazi wo ow’omu buvubuka bwo, naye ggwe tewali mwesigwa, ng’olimbalimba newaakubadde nga yali munno era mukazi wo gwe walagaana naye endagaano.<verse eid="MAL 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAL 2:15"/>Katonda teyabafuula omu mu mwoyo? Era lwaki yabafuula omu? Kubanga yali anoonya ezzadde eriritya Katonda. Kale mwekuume nnyo waleme kubaawo agoba mukazi we, era alimbalimba mukazi we ow’omu buvubuka bwe.<verse eid="MAL 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAL 2:16"/>“Kubanga nkyawa abafumbo okwawukana,” bw’ayogera <char style="nd">Mukama</char> Katonda wa Isirayiri, “n’omusajja ajooga mukazi we,” bw’ayogera <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ow’Eggye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 2:16">Kale mwekuumenga mu mwoyo gwammwe mubeerenga beesigwa.<verse eid="MAL 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Olunaku olw’Okusala Omusango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAL 2:17"/>
    <char style="nd">Mukama</char> mumukooyezza n’ebigambo byammwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 2:17">Naye mubuuza nti, “Tumukooyezza tutya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 2:17">Kubanga mwogera nti buli akola ekibi, mulungi mu maaso ga <char style="nd">Mukama</char>, era abasanyukira; oba nti, “Ali ludda wa Katonda ow’obwenkanya?”<verse eid="MAL 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAL 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 3:1"/>“Laba, ntuma omubaka wange, alinkulembera era alirongoosa ekkubo nga sinnajja: era Mukama gwe munoonya alijja mu yeekaalu ye nga tebamanyiridde; omubaka w’endagaano gwe musanyukira, laba ajja,” bw’ayogera <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ow’Eggye.<verse eid="MAL 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 3:2"/>“Naye ani ayinza okugumiikiriza olunaku olw’okujja kwe, era ani aliyimirira ye bw’alirabika? Kubanga ali ng’omuliro gw’oyo alongoosa effeeza era nga sabbuuni ow’abayoza. <verse eid="MAL 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 3:3"/>Era alituula n’atunula ng’oyo alongoosa ffeeza n’agimalamu amasengere, era alirongoosa batabani ba Leevi, bakabona ba Katonda, era alibasengejja ng’ezaabu n’effeeza bwe bisengejjebwa; balyoke baweeyo ssaddaaka mu butuukirivu. <verse eid="MAL 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 3:4"/>Awo ekiweebwayo ekya Yuda ne Yerusaalemi kiryoke kisanyuse <char style="nd">Mukama</char>, nga mu nnaku ez’edda era nga mu myaka egyayita.<verse eid="MAL 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 3:5"/>“Era mu kiseera ekyo awatali kulonzalonza ndibasemberera nsale omusango. Ndiyanguwa okuwa obujulizi ku baloga ne ku benzi ne ku abo abalayira eby’obulimba, ne ku abo abalyazaamaanya omupakasi empeera ye; abanyigiriza nnamwandu ne mulekwa, era abajoogereza munnaggwanga, abatatya <char style="nd">Mukama</char>,” bw’ayogera <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ow’Eggye.<verse eid="MAL 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 3:6"/>“Kubanga nze <char style="nd">Mukama</char> sijjulukuka: mmwe, batabani ba Yakobo, noolwekyo siribazikiriza. <verse eid="MAL 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 3:7"/>Okuva mu nnaku za bajjajjammwe mwakyuka ne mukyama okuva ku biragiro byange ne mutabikwata. Mudde gye ndi, nange nadda gye muli era nnaabasonyiwa,” bw’ayogera <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ow’Eggye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 3:7">“Naye mwebuuza nti, ‘Tunadda tutya?’<verse eid="MAL 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 3:8"/>“Omuntu alinyaga Katonda?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 3:8">“Naye mmwe munnyaga. Kyokka mugamba nti, ‘Tukunyaga tutya?’ </para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 3:8">“Mu biweebwayo ne mu kimu eky’ekkumi. <verse eid="MAL 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 3:9"/>Mukolimiddwa ekikolimo ekyo, kubanga mmwe, eggwanga lyonna munnyaga nze. <verse eid="MAL 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 3:10"/>Muleete ekimu eky’ekkumi ekijjuvu mu nnyumba yange, ennyumba yange ebeeremu emmere, era mungezese,” bw’ayogera <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ow’Eggye, “obanga siribaggulirawo ebituli eby’omu ggulu, ne mbawa omukisa ne gutabaako ne we guligya. <verse eid="MAL 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 3:11"/>Kale ndikuuma ennimiro zammwe ne zitazikirizibwa balabe; so n’omuzabbibu gwammwe ne gutakunkumula bibala byagwo ebitannatuuka kwengera,” bw’ayogera <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ow’Eggye. <verse eid="MAL 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 3:12"/>“Era amawanga gonna galibayita ba mukisa: kubanga muliba nsi esanyusa, kino ky’ekisuubizo,” bw’ayogera <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ow’Eggye.<verse eid="MAL 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 3:13"/>“Weewaawo ebigambo byammwe gye ndi bibadde bya bukambwe,” bw’ayogera <char style="nd">Mukama</char>.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 3:13">“Ate nga mugamba nti, ‘Twakwogerako tutya obubi?’ <verse eid="MAL 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 3:14"/>“Mwayogera nti, ‘Eby’okuweereza Katonda tebigasa, era kigasa ki okukwata ebiragiro bye era n’okutambulira mu maaso ga <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ow’Eggye ng’abakungubaga? <verse eid="MAL 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAL 3:15"/>Okuva kaakano abeegulumiza tubayita ba mukisa; abakozi b’ebibi bakulaakulana era n’abo abasoomoza Katonda nabo bawona.’ ”<verse eid="MAL 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAL 3:16"/>Abo abatya <char style="nd">Mukama</char> bayogeragana bokka ne bokka, <char style="nd">Mukama</char> n’abawulira. Ekitabo eky’okujjukira abatya <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ne balowooza ku linnya lye, ne kiwandiikibwa ng’alaba.<verse eid="MAL 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAL 3:17"/>“Kale baliba bange,” bw’ayogera <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ow’Eggye, “ku lunaku lwe ndibakyusizaako okuba ekintu kyange eky’omuwendo; era ndibasonyiwa ng’omuzadde bw’asonyiwa mutabani we amuweereza. <verse eid="MAL 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAL 3:18"/>Omulundi omulala mulyawula omutuukirivu n’omubi, oyo aweereza Katonda n’oyo atamuweereza.”<verse eid="MAL 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAL 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Olunaku lwa <char style="nd">Mukama</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 4:1"/>“Kubanga, laba, olunaku lujja, lwokya ng’ekikoomi, n’ab’amalala bonna n’abo bonna abakola ebibi baliba bisasiro: ku lunaku lwennyini balyokerwa ddala,” bw’ayogera <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ow’Eggye, “obutabalekerawo mulandira newaakubadde ettabi. <verse eid="MAL 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 4:2"/>Naye mmwe abatya erinnya lyange, enjuba ey’obutuukirivu eribaviirayo ng’erina okuwonya mu biwaawaatiro byayo. Mulifuluma ne muligita ng’ennyana ez’omu kiraalo. <verse eid="MAL 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 4:3"/>Era mulirinnya ku babi, kubanga baliba vvu wansi w’ebigere byammwe, ku lunaku lwe ndibalokolerako,” bw’ayogera <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ow’Eggye.<verse eid="MAL 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 4:4"/>“Mujjukire okugonderanga amateeka ga Musa omuddu wange, ebiragiro n’amateeka bye namukwasa ku Kolebu olwa Isirayiri yenna.<verse eid="MAL 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 4:5"/>“Laba, ndibatumira nnabbi Eriya, olunaku lwa <char style="nd">Mukama</char> olukulu olw’entiisa nga terunnatuuka, <verse eid="MAL 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 4:6"/>era alikomyawo omutima gwa bazadde eri abaana baabwe, n’omutima gw’abaana eri bazadde baabwe; nneme okukolimira ensi.”<verse eid="MAL 4:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 4"/>
</usx>
